## 7. Termination

Your rights under this license end automatically if you breach any of its
conditions.

If the breach is curable, your rights are reinstated retroactively provided you
cure the breach within 30 days of becoming aware of it and provided your rights
have not already been reinstated once under this section.

Sections 3 (g), 3 (h), 4, 5, 8, 9 and 11 survive termination.

