## 10. Definitions

**Licensor** is Levo Studio, the rights holder in the software.

**Software** is the work provided under this license, including source code,
build configuration, design assets and accompanying files, in every version
provided by the licensor.

**You** is the natural or legal person exercising rights under this license.

**Modified version** is any editing, adaptation, translation, extension or other
transformation of the software, as well as any work that builds upon it.

**Contribution** is any work that someone knowingly submits for inclusion in the
project, in particular by pull request.

**Publicly** means any circle of recipients beyond yourself.

